<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφοπλίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>get ready</i>, of meals, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρπον,
				δεῖπνον ἐ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.419
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαῖτα γέρουσιν ἐφοπλίζωμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.344
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρπα τ᾽ ἐφοπλισόμεσθα</span>
			<i>we will get ready our</i> suppers, <i><span class="en">
				8.503
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fit out, equip, make ready</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιόνους καὶ ἄμαξαν ἐφοπλίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.263
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆα] ἐφοπλίσσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.295
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1720
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>arm against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.244
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρων ὔμμιν ἐφοπλίσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.39
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Music.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.151.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 in prop. sense, <i>arm oneself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀγῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.617
				</span></i>
			; <i>get ready to attack</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγωοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.86
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
